<description>&lt;p&gt;Ambazonian separatists shot a journalist in Bamenda and a young girl was killed in the same area, showing continued attacks on civilians. Boko Haram is rebuilding its ranks by training about 8,000 children for a new generation of fighters. Cameroon is seeking drones and joint border patrols to secure the Nigeria-Cameroon frontier and has offered the Zina and Makary oil blocks to investors after a twelve-year halt. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNMW1GRVZLVWI4YldIeU9wU2l4dzV2Q3J4OWE4Z0J2VkZqQ1FZbWoyN3dpR1gwdFVtbzc1NWUzbmt0QmlORTNlV09EZlVVZWxZbXN6YU5jMHhOZGwtX042aXYyOXF2TDRKcjJVYUF3RUxWdUlHRHRvR3QtbE5kVDlaVWtHMXA0cjdiTzA4d3hn?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQSUIzYUZNQ1dfdm1ZWHAta0xWOW9OZnM5eUgySXJ6MmVuZzloZnBCME9tQ05VTE12TUVqcHE5WFIyTktUSlRoX0hpcFg5ajR2Wk1WOEZMWGNIYkJCQTRjUGx2dFlDRDhrSFB0WC1jY3FjX0NOTlNONEgwaXZZWXJaSW1NRjhqSlBlQnBF?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOYXIwZEx6THl4Y1REWnV2TFVhWnVpVVJHdzJGSExjTVZUV2ZDeGw1NUx4OV9zTlQtbUlPank5cGJ6TG9qR0Rqd1dTZzdjTEd6XzdtMU9TMXhDeWJrbHRQS1lZNXdGTHZOaWxRcTRNdEdHdi1UbGdoQjhWaS01NHJNTWswT0dZOFk2?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQUDl4TnJLU296QjdJNWJHVHk1ZDZIUU5rdDUzazZnelJLU1o5LUlndEt6TGhQRENFR1FRV0pPZ1NSUWVrYlhCemR1WVhCVzN1UDEyWFJBZXV2bXB5NWJmRDNjeWljTWc3b09QWlZGUDA1ekpZMU9BNnZOVEtvMHFCeHF5a2tpd1R6MjZSUm81NTY2WTNFaGpr?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQaXU3NElUbUtTNEswVGhTVlR4V3NlWVJkU